  "type": "html-template",
  "original": {
    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>第一章：南方来的绿信封</title>\n</head>\n\n<body style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0;\">\n\n    <section\n        style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #e6e6e6; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;\">\n\n        <section\n            style=\"max-width: 677px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #f2f0e9; box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\">\n\n            <!-- 1. 头部设计 (VI 标准版) -->\n            <section\n                style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a; padding: 50px 20px 40px 20px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 4px solid #8b1e1e; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;\">\n                <section style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; opacity: 0.6;\">\n                    <svg width=\"100\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 20\">\n                        <path d=\"M0,10 Q25,0 50,10 T100,10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f2f0e9\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n                        <path d=\"M10,18 Q35,8 60,18 T110,18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f2f0e9\" stroke-width=\"1\"\n                            opacity=\"0.5\" />\n                    </svg>\n                </section>\n                <section\n                    style=\"display: inline-block; border: 1px solid #8b1e1e; color: #8b1e1e; background-color: #2a2a2a; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 3px; padding: 4px 12px; margin-top: 30px;\">\n                    卷一 · 泥地里的神与鬼\n                </section>\n                <section\n                    style=\"font-size: 48px; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: 900; color: #f2f0e9; margin-top: 20px; letter-spacing: 4px; text-shadow: 2px 2px 0px #8b1e1e;\">\n                    野风渡\n                </section>\n                <section\n                    style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 300; color: #aaa; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-top: 25px; border-top: 1px solid #444; display: inline-block; padding-top: 15px;\">\n                    第一章：南方来的绿信封\n                </section>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- 2. 正文区域 -->\n            <section style=\"padding: 40px 25px 60px 25px;\">\n\n                <!-- 导语 -->\n                <section\n                    style=\"margin-bottom: 40px; border-left: 4px solid #2e7d32; padding-left: 15px; padding-top: 5px; padding-bottom: 5px; background-color: #e8f5e9;\">\n                    <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #1b5e20; line-height: 1.6; font-style: italic;\">\n                        “那时候，思念是可以触摸的。它是一张只有八分钱的邮票，是一张薄薄的绿色汇款单，是几千公里外寄回来的一缕带着工业糖精味的香风。”\n                    </p>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- 正文 -->\n                <section\n                    style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; color: #222; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n                    <span\n                        style=\"float: left; font-size: 3.5em; line-height: 0.8; font-weight: bold; color: #8b1e1e; margin-right: 8px; margin-top: 4px; font-family: 'Songti SC', serif;\">一</span>九九四年的春天，来得特别晚。\n                </section>\n\n                <section\n                    style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; color: #222; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n                    在那个年代，村里最让人心跳加速的声音，不是过年的鞭炮，也不是村部大喇叭里的秦腔，而是一阵特殊的自行车铃声。\n                </section>\n\n                <section\n                    style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; color: #222; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n                    “叮铃——叮铃——”\n                </section>\n\n                <section\n                    style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; color: #222; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n                    清脆，悠长，像一把锋利的剪刀，剪开了午后沉闷的空气。\n                </section>\n\n                <section\n                    style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; color: #222; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n                    那是乡邮递员老赵的“二八大杠”。那辆墨绿色的自行车除了铃铛不响哪都响，车后座挂着两个沉甸甸的帆布大兜子，上面印着褪色的黄色大字——“中国邮政”。\n                </section>\n\n                <section\n                    style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; color: #222; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n                    对于只有六岁的我来说，那两个兜子就像是哆啦A梦的口袋，里面装着整个世界。\n                </section>\n\n                <section\n                    style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; color: #222; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n                    “老林家！老林家！广东来的信！”\n                </section>\n\n                <section\n                    style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; color: #222; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n                    老赵一只脚撑着地，满头大汗地扯着嗓子在门口喊了一声。\n                </section>\n\n                <section\n                    style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; color: #222; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n                    正在猪圈里喂猪的母亲，手里的瓢“咣当”一声就掉了。她顾不上擦手上的猪食，在围裙上胡乱抹了两把，踉踉跄跄地往外跑。跑得太急，被门槛绊了一下，差点摔倒，但她连停都没停。\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- 视觉焦点：信封 -->\n                <section\n                    style=\"margin: 35px 0; border: 2px dashed #1b5e20; background-color: #f1f8e9; padding: 25px; position: relative;\">\n                    <div\n                        style=\"position: absolute; top: -10px; left: 20px; background-color: #f2f0e9; padding: 0 10px; font-size: 14px; color: #2e7d32; font-weight: bold;\">\n                        [ 航空信 ]</div>\n                    <p style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #333; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify;\">\n                        那是一个标准的航空信封。\n                        <br>\n                        边框上印着红蓝相间的斜条纹，右上角贴着一张八分钱的长城邮票。\n                        <br><br>\n                        我凑过去闻了闻。那信封上没有猪圈味，没有土腥味，也没有旱厕的氨水味。它有一股味道，一股甜腻的、陌生的香味。\n                        <br><br>\n                        <strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">后来我才知道，那是劣质洗发水混合着南方潮湿空气的味道，但在当时，我认为那就是“广东味”，是天堂的味道。</strong>\n                    </p>\n                </section>\n\n                <section\n                    style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; color: #222; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n                    那天晚上，家里破天荒地点了两盏煤油灯，把堂屋照得通亮。\n                </section>\n\n                <section\n                    style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; color: #222; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n                    父亲坐在门槛上抽旱烟，吧嗒吧嗒的，火星子一明一灭，映照着他那张沟壑纵横的脸。他的手在微微发抖，那是激动的。\n                </section>\n\n                <section\n                    style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; color: #222; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n                    母亲小心翼翼地用剪刀剪开信封口，动作慢得像是在给刚出生的婴儿剪脐带，生怕剪坏了里面的东西。\n                </section>\n\n                <section\n                    style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; color: #222; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n                    信纸被掏出来，展开。那是三张带红线的横格纸，密密麻麻写满了字。随信掉出来的，还有一张绿色的汇款单，和一张光面的彩色照片。\n                </section>\n\n                <section\n                    style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; color: #222; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n                    “大，娘，见字如面。”\n                </section>\n\n                <section\n                    style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; color: #222; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n                    我刚上小学一年级，认字不多，被父亲抓壮丁来读信。我结结巴巴地念着：“我在东莞的电子厂挺好的……厂子很大，有几千人……管吃管住……顿顿有大米饭，还有肉……”\n                </section>\n\n                <section\n                    style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; color: #222; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n                    听到“顿顿有肉”，母亲抹了一把眼泪，念叨着：“这就好，这就好，别饿着就行。这死妮子，走的时候身上就带了二十个煮鸡蛋，我都怕她饿死在路上。”\n                </section>\n\n                <section\n                    style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; color: #222; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n                    我继续念：“……这个月发了工资，加上加班费，一共三百块。我自己留了一百生活费，给家里寄了二百……”\n                </section>\n\n                <section\n                    style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; color: #222; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n                    二百块。\n                </section>\n\n                <section\n                    style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; color: #222; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n                    父亲磕烟袋锅的手停住了。屋子里的空气仿佛凝固了。\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- 视觉焦点：金钱的重量 -->\n                <section\n                    style=\"margin: 35px 0; border-top: 1px solid #ccc; border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 20px 0; text-align: center;\">\n                    <p style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #555; margin-bottom: 10px;\">在1994年的杏花村，二百块是什么概念？</p>\n                    <p style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 900; color: #1b5e20; line-height: 1.6;\">\n                        那是我们家种一季麦子，刨去化肥、农药、种子和提留款后，剩下的全部收入。\n                        <br>\n                        那是父亲起早贪黑、在土里刨食半年的血汗钱。\n                    </p>\n                    <p style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #555; margin-top: 10px;\">而姐姐，出去才三个月，就寄回来了。</p>\n                </section>\n\n                <section\n                    style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; color: #222; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n                    父亲颤巍巍地拿起那张绿色的汇款单，对着煤油灯看了又看。他不识字，但他认得那个红色的公章，认得那个阿拉伯数字“200”。他的手指粗糙得像树皮，在那张薄薄的纸上摩挲着，仿佛那不是纸，而是金箔。\n                </section>\n\n                <section\n                    style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; color: #222; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n                    “这妮子，出息了。”父亲的声音哽咽了，“比我有本事。我这辈子，没挣过这么多现钱。”\n                </section>\n\n                <section\n                    style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; color: #222; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n                    我拿起了那张照片。\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- 视觉焦点：照片里的秘密 -->\n                <section\n                    style=\"background-color: #fff; padding: 20px; margin: 35px 0; border: 1px solid #ddd; transform: rotate(-2deg); box-shadow: 3px 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\">\n                    <div\n                        style=\"border: 1px solid #eee; height: 200px; background-color: #333; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #ccc; margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n                        [ 彩色照片：深圳世界之窗留念 ]\n                    </div>\n                    <p style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #333; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify;\">\n                        照片上的姐姐，站在一个微缩的埃菲尔铁塔前。\n                        <br>\n                        她穿着一件当时最流行的大红色蝙蝠衫，下身是一条紧得要命的黑色健美裤，头发烫成了时髦的爆炸卷。\n                        <br><br>\n                        她笑得很灿烂，露出一口白牙。但我发现，她放在身侧的那只手，<strong>食指和中指上缠着厚厚的、已经发黑的医用胶布。</strong>\n                    </p>\n                </section>\n\n                <section\n                    style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; color: #222; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n                    “娘，姐的手咋了？”我指着照片问。\n                </section>\n\n                <section\n                    style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; color: #222; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n                    母亲凑过来，眯着眼看了半天，眼泪一下子就下来了。她一边擦眼泪，一边用袖子擦照片，生怕把上面的红章擦花了：“这是干活伤着了啊……电子厂的活细，那是流水线，手慢一点就要挨骂，还要被扣钱。这妮子从小就笨，肯定没少受罪……”\n                </section>\n\n                <section\n                    style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; color: #222; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n                    第二天，姐姐寄钱回来的消息，像风一样传遍了全村。\n                </section>\n\n                <section\n                    style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; color: #222; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n                    家里突然热闹了起来。平日里难得一见的亲戚都来了，甚至连隔壁那个总是为了地边子跟我们吵架的刘老三，也背着手在门口晃悠了好几圈，酸溜溜地说：“老林啊，你家这闺女算是养着了，是个金凤凰啊。”\n                </section>\n\n                <section\n                    style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; color: #222; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n                    还有人来借钱。父亲一律笑着回绝：“这钱是给牧娃子留着上学用的，谁也不借。”\n                </section>\n\n                <section\n                    style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; color: #222; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 40px;\">\n                    那是父亲腰杆挺得最直的一天。\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- 结尾：启蒙 -->\n                <section style=\"border-top: 1px solid #aaa; padding-top: 20px;\">\n                    <p style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #555; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify;\">\n                        那晚我失眠了。\n                        <br><br>\n                        我躺在土炕上，听着窗外呼啸的野风。我想象着那个叫“广东”的地方，想象着那里是不是遍地都是红色的蝙蝠衫，空气里是不是都飘着洗发水的香味。\n                        <br><br>\n                        我不知道的是，那二百块钱，是姐姐在流水线上像机器一样坐了整整三十个夜班换来的。但那封信，却在我心里种下了一颗种子——<strong>我也要走，我要去那个有香味的地方。</strong>\n                    </p>\n                </section>\n\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- 底部版权 -->\n            <section style=\"background-color: #2b2b2b; padding: 30px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n                <p style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #666; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">THE WILD WIND CROSSING\n                </p>\n                <p style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #999; margin: 0;\">© 野风渡 · 连载中</p>\n            </section>\n\n        </section>\n    </section>\n\n</body>\n\n</html>"
  },
  "html": "<section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0\" id=\"cw-layout-imported\"><section style=\"background-color: #e6e6e6; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0\"><section style=\"background-color: #f2f0e9; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08); box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 677px\"><section style=\"background-color: rgb(26, 26, 26); border-bottom: 4px solid rgb(139, 30, 30); box-sizing: border-box; display: block; padding: 50px 20px 40px; text-align: center; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><p style=\"border-top: 1px solid rgb(68, 68, 68); box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(170, 170, 170); display: inline-block; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-top: 0px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding-top: 15px; text-indent: 0px; width: 100%;\">开场第一段：比赛结束后，人们先看到了比分。阅读一篇文章，也需要先交代背景，让读者知道事情从哪里开始。</p></section><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 40px 25px 60px 25px\"><section style=\"background-color: #e8f5e9; border-left: 4px solid #2e7d32; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 40px; padding-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 15px; padding-top: 5px\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #1b5e20; font-size: 16px; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: justify\">开场第二段：比分接近，真正需要讨论的是关键时刻的判断。连续的正文应留在同一个阅读容器里，左右都应有清楚的留白。</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #1b5e20; font-size: 16px; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: justify\">开场第三段：接下来再进入具体章节。段落数量改变时，不应丢失内容，不应贴边，也不应为每段重复一层巨大的卡片内边距。</p></section><section><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #222; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; margin: 0 0 18px; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: justify\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1499951360447-b19be8fe80f5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\" alt=\"桌面上的阅读与写作\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 16px 0; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"></p></section><section><h2 style=\"color: #222; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.5; margin: 28px 0 18px\">从标题开始，建立阅读节奏</h2><section><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #222; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; margin: 0 0 18px; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: justify\">标题需要一个清楚的重心。<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #1a1a1a\">重点句只强调一次</strong>，其余正文让段落长度、行距和留白承担节奏。</p></section><section style=\"background-color: #e8f5e9; border-left: 4px solid #2e7d32; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 40px; padding-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 15px; padding-top: 5px\"><blockquote style=\"border: 0; border-left: 0; margin: 0; padding: 0\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #1b5e20; font-size: 16px; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: justify\">排版的任务，是把内容的关系呈现出来。</p></blockquote></section><section><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #222; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; margin: 0 0 18px; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: justify\">每种风格都应该有自己的声音，同时让正文保持完整、清楚和可读。</p></section></section><section><h2 style=\"color: #222; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.5; margin: 28px 0 18px\">三个可以马上检查的地方</h2><section><ul style=\"color: #222\"><li>标题是否有独立的视觉重心</li><li>章节之间是否留出呼吸空间</li><li>重点是否与普通正文形成清楚层级</li></ul></section><section><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #222; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; margin: 0 0 18px; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: justify\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1455390582262-044cdead277a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\" alt=\"写作中的页面\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 16px 0; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"></p></section><section><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #222; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; margin: 0 0 18px; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: justify\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1515378791036-0648a3ef77b2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\" alt=\"工作台上的笔记\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 16px 0; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"></p></section><section><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; color: #222; margin: 18px 0; table-layout: fixed; width: 100%\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border: 1px solid #d8dee5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 8px\">检查项</th><th style=\"border: 1px solid #d8dee5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 8px\">观察方式</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #d8dee5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 8px\">标题</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #d8dee5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 8px\">第一眼能否找到主题</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #d8dee5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 8px\">正文</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #d8dee5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 8px\">是否能够连续阅读</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #d8dee5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 8px\">引用</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #d8dee5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 8px\">是否与作者叙述区分</td></tr></tbody></table></section><section><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #222; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; margin: 0 0 18px; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: justify\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544947950-fa07a98d237f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\" alt=\"打开的杂志与页面\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 16px 0; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"></p></section></section><section><h2 style=\"color: #222; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.5; margin: 28px 0 18px\">把风格落实到每一个细节</h2><section><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #222; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; margin: 0 0 18px; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: justify\">报纸用硬边栏线建立秩序，杂志用大留白放慢速度，信笺让段落像一次自然的交谈。</p></section><section><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #222; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; margin: 0 0 18px; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: justify\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1481627834876-b7833e8f5570?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\" alt=\"阅读中的书页\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 16px 0; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"></p></section><section><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #222; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; margin: 0 0 18px; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: justify\">一个完整的句子，不应该为了装饰被删掉。一张原有的表格，也不应该被换成没有事实来源的数字。</p></section><section><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #222; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; margin: 0 0 18px; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: justify\">读完之后，留下一个清楚的观点，比留下许多重复的色块更有价值。</p></section></section></section></section></section></section>",
  "layoutPrompt": "[cw-imported-style:{\"root\":\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0\",\"elements\":{\"blockquote\":\"border-left:3px solid #94a3b8;padding:12px 16px;margin:18px 0\",\"img\":\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:16px 0\",\"p\":\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #222; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; margin: 0 0 18px; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: justify\",\"strong\":\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #1a1a1a\",\"table\":\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;table-layout:fixed;margin:18px 0\",\"td\":\"border:1px solid #d8dee5;padding:8px;overflow-wrap:anywhere\",\"th\":\"border:1px solid #d8dee5;padding:8px;overflow-wrap:anywhere\"},\"structure\":{\"version\":2,\"frame\":\"<section style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0\\\"><section style=\\\"background-color: #e6e6e6; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#39;PingFang SC&#39;, &#39;Hiragino Sans GB&#39;, &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;, &#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0\\\"><section style=\\\"background-color: #f2f0e9; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08); box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 677px\\\"><section style=\\\"background-color: #1a1a1a; border-bottom: 4px solid #8b1e1e; box-sizing: border-box; display: block; padding: 50px 20px 40px 20px; text-align: center\\\"><h1 style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #f2f0e9; font-size: 48px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 4px; line-height: 1.1; margin-top: 20px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; text-indent: 0; width: 100%\\\">{{title}}</h1><p style=\\\"border-top: 1px solid #444; box-sizing: border-box; color: #aaa; display: inline-block; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-top: 25px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding-top: 15px; text-indent: 0; width: 100%\\\">{{subtitle}}</p></section><section style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 40px 25px 60px 25px\\\">{{body}}</section></section></section></section>\",\"headerLead\":true,\"lead\":{\"frame\":\"<section style=\\\"background-color: #e8f5e9; border-left: 4px solid #2e7d32; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 40px; padding-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 15px; padding-top: 5px\\\">{{content}}</section>\",\"style\":\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #1b5e20; font-size: 16px; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0\"},\"sections\":{\"2\":[{\"frame\":\"<section><h2 style=\\\"color: #222; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.5; margin: 28px 0 18px\\\">{{heading}}</h2>{{body}}</section>\",\"paragraph\":{\"frame\":\"<section>{{content}}</section>\",\"style\":\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #222; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: justify\"},\"image\":{\"frame\":\"\"}}]},\"blocks\":{\"body\":{\"frame\":\"<section>{{content}}</section>\",\"style\":\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #222; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; margin: 0 0 18px; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: justify\"},\"image\":{\"frame\":\"<section>{{content}}</section>\"},\"list\":{\"frame\":\"<section>{{content}}</section>\"},\"note\":{\"frame\":\"<section>{{content}}</section>\"},\"quote\":{\"frame\":\"<section style=\\\"background-color: #e8f5e9; border-left: 4px solid #2e7d32; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 40px; padding-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 15px; padding-top: 5px\\\">{{content}}</section>\",\"style\":\"border: 0; border-left: 0; margin: 0; padding: 0\",\"textStyle\":\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #1b5e20; font-size: 16px; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0\"},\"rule\":{\"frame\":\"<section>{{content}}</section>\"},\"table\":{\"frame\":\"<section>{{content}}</section>\"}}}}]",
